<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PALS RAISES YR SHR, DIV.</title>
<headline>PALS RAISES YR SHR, DIV.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)    32.5	   vs  23.2</p>
<p>    Yr div (cts)	    7.0	   vs   4.5   </p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.25	  vs   2.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   5.86	  vs   4.50</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.12	  vs   1.52 </p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.77	  vs   2.14</p>
<p>    Turnover		 74.31	  vs  65.49  </p>
<p>Div payable Nov 1 </p>
<p>on register Oct 18</p>
<p>Full name: Pals Holdings Ltd  (clothing)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said the local market remained sluggish but</p>
<p>it was expanding into the more favourable export market.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
